[P_02_Seoulthree_backalleyconv]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=NKCol_Sun- Incompetence! Incompetence! Your orders were to maintain an overwatch while the Special Forces lead Jong away. 
Speech_0002L=NKSol_Bo- Sorry sir!
Speech_0003L=NKCol_Sun- Sorry is not good enough. Tactically, we looked like fools. You think they will not report our incompetence to their superiors?!
Speech_0009L=NKSol_Bo- It was my mistake, sir.
Speech_0010L=NKCol_Sun- Yes. But they don't know that. Your mistake is now my mistake! You may have cost me a promotion!
Speech_0011L=NKSol_Bo- Sir I--
Speech_0012L=NKCol_Sun- Enough... I have had it with your idiocy!
Speech_0004L=NKCol_Sun- Dong!
Speech_0005L=NKSol_Dong- Yes sir!
Speech_0006L=NKCol_Sun- What just happened here?
Speech_0007L=NKSol_Dong- You executed a traitor for deserting his post, sir!
Speech_0008L=NKCol_Sun- I knew I could count on you Dong. If I don't get demoted for this, I'll make sure to put in a commendation for you.
Speech_0013L=NKSol_Dong- Thank you Sir.

[P_02_Seoulthree_backalleyinterro]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0005L=NKCol_Sun- Damn! Ok... I surrender... You're special forces, you're probably after our special forces... we covered their escape from the hotel with some guy named Jong. I don't know where they took him, but they went down the alley past the fence.

