Speech_0004L=NKSol_Ming- Those special forces guys said that another team will come pick him up at dawn... once the fighting calms down for the day.
Speech_0005L=NKSol_Jin- Dawn?
Speech_0006L=NKSol_Ming- Hopefully he'll just sleep until then.

