[P_02_Seoulthree_hotelconv]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=NKSol_Chen- Damn! It's dangerous out there!
Speech_0002L=NKSol_Feng- It's a war... what do you expect?
Speech_0003L=NKSol_Chen- Look, hurry up and get this place secured so you can patrol with me... I don't want to get killed out there.
Speech_0004L=NKSol_Feng- We're doing everything we can...see the turret is up.
Speech_0005L=NKSol_Chen- Good. Li. What about power?
Speech_0006L=NKSol_Li- The whole grid is down. We have no control over it, but it could come back anytime.
Speech_0007L=NKSol_Chen- Alright. Well, make sure the rooms are clear so at least we know the inside of the building is safe.

[P_02_Seoulthree_Jong]

[P_02_Seoulthree_Jong_crazy]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=Jong- I can't believe this. I'm going to die for sure.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0002L=Jong- I wish they would get me out of here. Ha! I wish anybody would get me out of here.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0003L=Jong- How much longer will I have to wait?
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0004L=Jong- This is driving me crazy!
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0005L=Jong- Why would they relocate me... it's not like the Americans know anything.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0006L=Jong- I just hope that someone doesn't bomb this building by mistake.

[P_02_Seoulthree_Jongcheck]

[P_02_Seoulthree_Jonginterro]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=Jong- Oh... you... you mean you're not going to kill me? Oh thank god... just get me out of here then... I don't care where. I'll tell your superiors everything.
Speech_0004L=Jong- Oh no, no please, don't kill me. I know secrets about North Korea's chemical and biological weapons programs. It's too complex to talk about it here... we don't have time. Get me out of here. I'll tell your superiors everything.

[P_02_Seoulthree_Lambertcomms]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=LAMBERT - Your mission is to capture Jong Pom-chu alive. Word is he's holed up in a hotel just up the street. We'll figure out an exit scenario for all of you once you get you hands on him.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0011L=Lambert- What are you doing? It turns out Jong has been relocated. That guy was a double. You're lucky you didn't just kill the person you're supposed to capture. See if you can interrogate an officer nearby to find out where Jong is.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0012L=Lambert- From the sounds of it, Jong has already been moved. Let's hope the NKA hasn't already smuggled him out. Find an officer and interrogate him for information.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0004L=Lambert- Damn. If Jong has been relocated by NKA Special Forces, he might already be gone. I'll see if I can dig up any more information.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0005L=Lambert- Reagan Carrier group is filing a barnyard full of flight req's. It looks like intensive bombing of your area is about to commence in preparation for fly-overs. If you spot any AA, make sure to take it.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0040L=Lambert- Bad news. Another plane from Reagan Carrier Group is inbound over your sector.
Speech_0041L=Lambert- You have to take out those anti-air emplacements in the next five minutes.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0042L=Lambert- You have to take out those anti-air emplacements in the next four minutes.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0043L=Lambert- You have to take out those anti-air emplacements in the next three minutes.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0044L=Lambert- You have to take out those anti-air emplacements in the next two minutes.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0045L=Lambert- You have to take out those anti-air emplacements in the next sixty seconds.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0046L=Lambert- My god... you're too late... they just shot down another aircraft... mission over!
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0038L=Lambert- Set explosives on the AA and take them both out.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0039L=Lambert- Good work. That takes care of the AA... but watch yourselves... looks like you have some reinforcements incoming.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0014L=Lambert- Sit tight you two. I have another asset on the ground, he's just gotten hold of the guys who relocated Jong.
Speech_0015L=AgentOne- Patch us in.
Speech_0016L=Lambert- Alright, Fisher, go ahead...
Speech_0017L=Fisher- I've got someone who wants to talk to you...
Speech_0018L=AgentOne- Roger... ask him where they took Jong.
Speech_0019L=Fisher- Where did you take Jong?
Speech_0020L=NKElite_Soo- I... I don't know what you're talking about...
Speech_0021L=Fisher- He's not answering... should I kill him?
Speech_0022L=AgentOne- Negative! Negative!
Speech_0023L=Fisher- Alright... they say I should kill you, so--
Speech_0024L=NKElite_Soo- Wait... okay... Jong... we moved him to a cyber caf? just off the fish market by the river.
Speech_0025L=Fisher- Is that what you needed to know guys?
Speech_0026L=AgentOne- Ah... affirmative... thanks a lot, sir. We owe you one.
Speech_0027L=Fisher- Welcome to the team.
Speech_0028L=AgentOne- Did he say 'Fisher'?
Speech_0029L=AgentTwo- Must be his call-sign...
Speech_0030L=AgentOne- You think there are other Splinter Cells?
Speech_0031L=AgentTwo- Nah... we're the first.
Speech_0032L=Lambert- Cut the chit-chat you two. Get to the cyber caf?... fast.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0047L=Lambert- It looks like Jong has a boat down there in case he needs to make an emergency escape. Might be a good idea to cut off his exit scenario.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0033L=Lambert- Jong is somewhere in this caf?. Remember, we need him alive. Once you have him, bring him down to the truck out front and we'll extract you.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0037L=Lambert- Good job. Get Jong to the truck and we'll get you out of there.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0035L=Lambert- Jong is getting away! Don't let him escape in his boat!
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0036L=Lambert- Jong is trying to get to his boat. Good thing you disabled it. Go grab him from the docks and bring him back to the truck.
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0034L=Lambert- My God! What are you thinking?! I told you we needed Jong alive! Neither of you will ever qualify as Splinter Cell operatives! Mission Over!

