[P_02_Seoulthree_templefront]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=NKSol_Shing- I don't think we can fix it.
Speech_0002L=NKSol_Chul- Well then what are we going to do?
Speech_0003L=NKSol_Shing- Look it's not important. We're in position. It doesn't matter if we're mobile. As long as the radar is operational, we're fine.
Speech_0004L=NKSol_Chul- What if we get orders to roll out?
Speech_0005L=NKSol_Shing- Then we report the damage and we wait for the engineering team to come get us.

[P_02_Seoulthree_templefront_interro]
Speech_-001L=(null)
Speech_0001L=NKSol_Shing- Oh god... please... you don't need to kill me... our tank is stuck here anyway... please... I don't know anymore...
Speech_0002L=NKSol_Shing- Okay... okay... there's more. The tanks can still fire. The only way to disable them is to take out the radar dish, that way they can't track their targets.
